            <ArticleTitle>Intraoperative Common Carotid Artery Injury during Ventriculoperitoneal Shunt Surgery.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>117-119</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.7461/jcen.2017.19.2.117</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>There are a number of complications associated with ventriculoperitoneal shunt (VPS) surgery. The authors present a rare case of iatrogenic common carotid artery injury during VPS surgery.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
